    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho mu kiseera Daudi kye yafugiramu Isiraeli endhala yaagwa, yaalumira emyaka esatu egiiraganwaku. Daudi yaaja yeebuuza ku Musengwa Katonda. Musengwa Katonda yaamukoba ati: “Saulo n'ab'endhu ye baliku omusango ogw'obutemo, kuba Saulo yaita Abagibeoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale kyabazinga Daudi yaayeta Abagibeoni. Abagibeoni abo tibaali Baisiraeli, aye baali Abamori abaawonagho. Saulo yayenda okwita Abagibeoni abo kuba yalumirwanga inho Abaisiraeli n'ab'omu kika kya Yuda, waire nga Abaisiraeli abo baali bamaze okulayirira Abagibeoni abo obutabaita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.9.3+JOS.9.4+JOS.9.5+JOS.9.6+JOS.9.7+JOS.9.8+JOS.9.9+JOS.9.10+JOS.9.11+JOS.9.12+JOS.9.13+JOS.9.14+JOS.9.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 9:3-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale Daudi yaakoba Abagibeoni ati: “Mbakolere ki? Mutango ki gwe mbe mbaghe, memale musabire enkabi abantu ba Musengwa Katonda ababe ku bubwe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagibeoni baamwiramu bati: “Ensonga eri ghagati ghaife ni Saulo oba n'ab'endhu ye, tesobola kuwaagho na feeza oba na zaabu. Era titwenda omuntu waire omulala ati aitibwe mu Isiraeli ku lwaife.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Daudi n'okubabuuza ati: “Buti mukoba mbakolere ki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamwiramu bati: “Saulo oyo yatutirimbula, yaayenda bwa kutuzikiriza twenatwena tuweegho mu Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni batughe abantu musanvu ku baidhukulu be, tubasibe emigugha mu nkoto tubalengeedhie mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda e Gibea ku lusozi lwa Musengwa Katonda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga yaabairamu ati: “Ndidha kubagha abantu abo omusanvu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye kyabazinga Daudi yaawonia Mefiboshethi mutabane wa Yonathani era mwidhukulu wa Saulo, yaaloba kumughaayo, olw'ekirayiro Daudi oyo ni Yonathani oyo mutabane wa Saulo kye baakola mu liina lya Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.20.15+1SA.20.16+1SA.20.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 20:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.1+2SA.9.2+2SA.9.3+2SA.9.4+2SA.9.5+2SA.9.6+2SA.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale kyabazinga yaaghaayo abalenzi ababiri batabane ba Saulo be yazaala mu Rizupa mughala wa Aya, omulala nga ni Arumoni ate owundi yaaba nga ni Mefiboshethi. Era yaaghaayo n'abalenzi abataanu Merabu mughala wa Saulo be yazaala ni Adirieli mutabane wa Barazillai Omumeholathi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 18:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo omusanvu yaabaghaayo eri Abagibeoni babaghanika baabalengeedhia mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda ku lusozi, era baafiira ghalala boonaboona. Baabaita mu nnaku edhisooka edh'amakungula, ng'abantu baakainhama okukungula sayiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Rizupa mughala wa Aya era eyali muka Saulo ow'embali, yaatoola ekutiya yaagyeyalira ku lubaale, okuva ku kiseera eky'amakungula ghe kyainhamira okutuusa ku ekiseera ekya amaadhi okugwa. Omusana yaaloba kuganhanga nhonhi kwidha ku mirambo egyo, ate obwire yaalobanga kuganha nsolo kugiidhaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baakobera Daudi ebyo Rizupa mughala wa Aya era eyali muka Saulo bye yakola, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaaja yaatoola amagumba ga Saulo n'aga Yonathani mutabane wa Saulo oyo, ku bantu ab'e Yabeshi eky'omu Gileadi. Abantu ab'e Yabeshi abo baali nga baibye amagumba ago mu luya olw'ekibuga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.8+1SA.31.9+1SA.31.10+1SA.31.11+1SA.31.12+1SA.31.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 31:8-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bethi Shani, Abafilisiti ye baabaghanika ni babalengeedhia ku lunaku lwe baabaitiraku ku lusozi Giliboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaatoolayo amagumba ga Saulo n'aga Yonathani mutabane we. Era baasoloza n'amagumba aga bale be baaghanika ni babalengeedhia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale baaziika amagumba ga Saulo n'aga mutabane we Yonathani mu magombe ga Kishi lata wa Saulo oyo e Zela mu kiketezo kya Benjamini. Era baakola byonabyona kyabazinga Daudi bye yalagira. Ebyo bwe byawa, Katonda yaabagha bye baasabira ensi yaibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabiri Abafilisiti bairamu okulwana n'Abaisiraeli. Kale Daudi yaaja n'abasaadha be okulwana n'Abafilisiti abo. Daudi oyo yaakoogha inho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaabaagho Ishibibenobu nga wa ku lulyo olw'abantu abawaigufu. Yali n'eifumo lya kyuma kya kikomo nga lizitogha kilo ng'oti isatu n'ekitundu, era nga yeesibye olusibiro mu nkende olwaliku empiima empyaka. Agho omusaadha oyo yaagezaaku okwita Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Abishai mutabane wa Zeruia yaidha yaayamba Daudi, yaalumba Omufilisiti oyo yaamwita. Agho abasaadha ba Daudi baamulayirira bati: “Iwe oli ng'oti itaala lya Isiraeli, kale tokairayo kuja n'ife mu lutalo, tiikulwa ng'eitaala eryo lizima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakyab 11:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.132.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 132:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
