              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ghaabalukagho kabiri olutalo olundi n'Abafilisiti e Gobu. Elihanani mutabane wa Yaareoregimu Omubethilehemu, Goliathi Omugitti eyali n'eifumo eryali n'olunhago olunene olwaga n'ekiti kye balukisa olugoye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.19"
            ]
          }
